---
name: icons
type: registry:ui
title: Icons
description: A typed icon component with size variants, Lucide icons, and a custom icon set.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
  - '@lucide/svelte'
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/index.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icons.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icons.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon/icon.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon/icon.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon/icon.types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon/icon.types.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon/icon.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon/icon.variants.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-grid.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-grid.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-gallery.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-gallery.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-set/types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-set/types.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-set/nav-arrow.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-set/nav-arrow.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-set/x-circle-solid.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-set/x-circle-solid.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-set/cloud.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-set/cloud.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-set/key-rounded.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-set/key-rounded.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/icons/icon-set/mail-rounded.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/icons/icon-set/mail-rounded.svelte'
---

Use `Icon` with a typed `icon` key and optional `size`. Browse the whole set with `IconGallery`, or
import individual SVGs from `icon-set` directly.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { Icon } from '~/components/icons';
</script>

<Icon icon="chevron-right" size="md" />
<Icon icon="shopping-cart" size="lg" />
```
